e done by the targets by %d%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你每回合都从符文皮肤中释放出黑暗能量。\n\t\t你每拥有一个符文，就会用衰老尖刺攻击视野内的一名随机敌人，造成 %0.2f 霜暮伤害。\n\t\t每个敌人每回合只会被尖刺攻击一次。\n\t\t如果你的生命值在 1 以下，尖刺还会使目标造成的伤害减少 %d%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"369acb72613e88d1300ac1ac0e69586e291374b9c122e61312503a2306f75016","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"df06a1bdbb80bbc01a716d4b700dee33ebf54ab6ed3967df2e0e766bea249083","logical_entry_identity":"349b078b9da4557fcca36581634f2e76f070210d9450fbd70c07fdb062c2c2bb","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Anomaly Temporal Bubble","source_tag":"talent name","target":"异常：时空气泡"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2ae1326b57f17531b832b610862f4ff8afe20ccf756c6bdceab3b14ce43c0fde","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"df06f31a9f3577f99a584747f7216eb04b00ddeb8d1aa4a6b87779dab3ca0b4e","logical_entry_identity":"4655fa84d9d1d77aa4da5fce819bf38691a83a76fecb0e39cc1295b11dd3a62c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A shifting form of darkest night that seems to reflect your deepest fears.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一团由最深沉的黑夜凝聚而成、不断变幻的形体，似乎映照出你内心深处的恐惧。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5976632aefa4715dea559bb22f91456a1120df57cda50d107439db6750fb25d8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"df0d4922b81093a434fe981f1d504c063e5a4d0efdc1dc1a70973c92527f9335","logical_entry_identity":"1f5e4e32ef3fca10070445a28b5e95b26946e181a6f1d410553dfd3a07f9f864","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"phasing","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"相位"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"bf27c7e7d839cafa0a15d65b7933c68e80287e87c3b833fb14755fde1d767140"}}